+
+Issues encountered
+
+- The first classifier pass regressed the existing query behavior for long descriptive prompts like `authentication system JWT login token generation password verification`; `query::tests::test_detect_keyword_heavy_explore` failed. I fixed that by adding a deterministic descriptive-phrase fallback inside the new classifier so those prompts still map to the understanding/explore path.
+- `cd daemon && cargo build --release` was initially blocked by unrelated compile drift in `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/event_capture.rs`: three payload initializers were missing the new `replay_snapshot_json` field. I added `replay_snapshot_json: None` to the `MemoryCreatedPayload`, `MemoryUpdatedPayload`, and `MemoryInvalidatedPayload` initializers so the required release build could pass.
+
+Final status: complete

