Verification passed: `cargo test -p lattice-core --lib retrieval_v1::intent_tests`, `cargo test -p lattice-core --lib query::tests`, and `cargo build --release`. I also had to make a small compile-only integration fix in [event_capture.rs](/home/pete/cadres/lattice/daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/event_capture.rs:473) by filling the new `replay_snapshot_json` field on three payload initializers so the required release build would complete. The task report is written to [results/T27.md](/home/pete/cadres/lattice/docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/results/T27.md:1).
