+- `cd daemon && cargo build --release` was initially blocked by unrelated compile drift in `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/event_capture.rs`: three payload initializers were missing the new `replay_snapshot_json` field. I added `replay_snapshot_json: None` to the `MemoryCreatedPayload`, `MemoryUpdatedPayload`, and `MemoryInvalidatedPayload` initializers so the required release build could pass.
